    "body": "After interacting with the demo, scrolling back into the middle of the hero left the story frozen at 100%. Unlock presentation from measured reverse scroll travel, reconcile section reveals on scroll/tab return, and keep the selected demo mode and all edited data while replaying. Shop and internal views now animate their own live modules.\n\nApply the DevoraLabs name and an original D + L SVG logo throughout the six-style website, including headers, footers, shared toolbar, metadata and favicon.\n\nValidation: `npm run build` passes all 11 tests. Browser regression checks pass three real wheel cycles for all five motion styles, keyboard scrolling, mobile One line, repeated CSS section animations, cart/approval/filter/form/brief preservation across replay and VI/EN/style changes, original style mobile branding, and reduced motion. No browser page errors. Reproduction and checks are documented in QA-DEVORALABS.md.\r\n",
